\newlabel{tab:quality}{{1}{3}{Comparison of SCIT with external codecs on 300 LibriSpeech test-clean utterances. Entries are means [95\% bootstrap confidence intervals]. The first three rows are rate matched at a nominal 1.5~kbit/s; bold means are the best within this group. Opus (6~kbit/s) and lossless PCM are references at different bitrates. Lower mel-L1 and higher STOI/PESQ-WB are better}{table.1}{}}
