\newlabel{tab:robustness}{{2}{3}{Differences between SCIT-LCA and SCIT under transport perturbations on the full LibriSpeech test-clean set ($N=2{,}620$, $L=3$). $\Delta =\mathrm {SCIT\text {-}LCA}-\mathrm {SCIT}$; lower mel-L1 and higher STOI/PESQ-WB favour SCIT-LCA}{table.2}{}}
